Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), targetcli-fb, python3-rtslib-fb, ${misc:Depends}
Description: openmediavault iSCSI target plugin
 Exports file-backed LUNs over iSCSI using the LIO kernel target. The
 configuration is managed through the openmediavault workbench and
 applied with targetcli-fb/rtslib-fb.
